{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>ReEnchant</i>, you play as an ancient Tree Spirit protecting your home from the lumberjacks. As they cut deeper into the woods, it\u2019s up to you to restore the forest and preserve its beauty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Pace. Your Path. Your Forest.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ReEnchant welcomes every wanderer.</strong> If you\u2019re looking for a cozy, relaxed experience \u2014 a quiet walk through the woods \u2014 simply stick to the lowest difficulty and enjoy the journey. Even if the Lumberjacks bring your forest to 0 health, the game won\u2019t punish you. They lose interest, the woods calm down, and the difficulty gently resets to day 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you want a demanding roguelike challenge \u2014 where every second matters, movement must be mastered, and your tree\u2011planting needs to be planned days ahead \u2014 you can unlock the higher difficulties. Keep your forest alive, push deeper, and face the Lumberjacks at their most relentless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.poster.avif?t=1772820205\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.webm?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.mp4?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your forest from the lumberjacks without harming them. Apples calm them, birches slow their steps, and oaks blunt their axes. Not enough to send them away forever \u2014 but enough to keep your forest safe until you\u2019re ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.poster.avif?t=1772820205\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.webm?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.mp4?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.poster.avif?t=1772820205\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.webm?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/37936b9057cbed4e0413b88d2de56971.mp4?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend Forest Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping the creatures of the forest is just as important as growing trees. Ducklings often get lost\u2026 but you\u2019re there to guide them. A frog may need water, a deer might be searching for a treat, and those fairyflies are always tricky to catch. But you can handle it \u2014 you can handle anything you choose to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.poster.avif?t=1772820205\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.webm?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/333ef270a44e037cbc422c2db0bd5154.mp4?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything else fails, drop some Mana. It will cause the lumberjacks to sit down and meditate. Collect Mana to gain a burst of speed, or place it along your path and retrieve it for a swift return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.poster.avif?t=1772820205\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.webm?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/9e43255571d06e1ec839abe14404d91f.mp4?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short Playtime, High Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lowest difficulty will take you 2\u20134 hours to complete. For those seeking more, higher difficulty levels and procedurally generated tree placements offer further challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without Words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> features no spoken or written words. Discover its secrets by observing and exploring your way through the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why I made ReEnchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ReEnchant </i>was born in the depths of winter, when my longing for green trees became too strong to ignore. I turned to Kingdom, a game I\u2019ve always loved for its mystical forests, but felt sad when, in the end, all the trees were chopped down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to reverse that feeling \u2014 to create a game where nature fights back and beauty triumphs over destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I find peace in my daily walks through the forest, and I hope some of that meditative joy has found its way into <i>ReEnchant</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why I made ReEnchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ReEnchant </i>was born in the depths of winter, when my longing for green trees became too strong to ignore. I turned to Kingdom, a game I\u2019ve always loved for its mystical forests, but felt sad when, in the end, all the trees were chopped down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to reverse that feeling \u2014 to create a game where nature fights back and beauty triumphs over destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I find peace in my daily walks through the forest, and I hope some of that meditative joy has found its way into <i>ReEnchant</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Press &amp; Media  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Kit: </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3984730/e39509a6ba921b353df2eccf1c258847fc3ff238.jpg"},{"name":"2!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3984730/fad647e106d3429bd1e30537ff2230a44a325c10.jpg"},{"name":"3!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/i