rest to 0 health, the game won\u2019t punish you. They lose interest, the woods calm down, and the difficulty gently resets to day 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you want a demanding roguelike challenge \u2014 where every second matters, movement must be mastered, and your tree\u2011planting needs to be planned days ahead \u2014 you can unlock the higher difficulties. Keep your forest alive, push deeper, and face the Lumberjacks at their most relentless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.poster.avif?t=1772820205\" width=320 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.webm?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/a127ac61b11fe1c38907eaba7d534633.mp4?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your forest from the lumberjacks without harming them. Apples calm them, birches slow their steps, and oaks blunt their axes. Not enough to send them away forever \u2014 but enough to keep your forest safe until you\u2019re ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.poster.avif?t=1772820205\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984730/extras/f08a16db2cb7a52739aaca905d7efa4f.webm?t=1772820205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=